bility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</strong>应花椒学社邀请，为四十余家餐饮人带来《走好每一步，连锁加盟又快又稳》专题分享。此次分享紧扣<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">“商业特许经营”</strong>这一经营模式，马俊龙律师深度打磨三小时独家精品课程，剖析餐饮行业连锁加盟的奥秘。马俊龙律师专业生动的分享获得一致好评。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 95%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72Im6PrCOHB31eTbwEas2IV3B09BDGay62fT09RGmRtoRRoxPuYXbwVbPqDPGCmyKswsyOIfImibRLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 610.969px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72Im6PrCOHB31eTbwEas2IV3B09BDGay62fT09RGmRtoRRoxPuYXbwVbPqDPGCmyKswsyOIfImibRLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"3\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br></p><section style=\"transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"z-index: -20;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: right;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-heig